  puzzleSource: Hiligaynon_Level2
  across:
  - 1. WALA - This refers to the side opposite the right, or the hand on that side.
  - 4. ASO - This is the visible gas released when something burns.
  - 5. MOTON - This is a wheel-and-rope device used to lift heavy objects.
  down:
  - 2. ANO - This is the opening at the end of the digestive tract.
  - 3. POLO - This is a piece of land completely surrounded by water.
  - 4. ANI - This is the season or act of gathering ripe rice from the fields.
